Third-party data
----------------
This license applies to the NodeTaxi source code (the Lua files at the root of
the addon and the scripts in tools/) only. It does not apply to:

  * node coordinate data in data.lua, compiled from public Classic
    coordinate data and normalized by NodeTaxi;
  * zone connection coordinates in transitions.lua, derived from Carbonite's
    Classic ZoneConnections dataset (IrcDirk and contributors), which is
    GPLv3; that data file is distributed under GPLv3;
  * zone corridor polylines in corridors.lua, derived from Shortest Path
    Forever's navigation maps (Cillian Berragan and contributors), which is
    GPLv3; that data file is distributed under GPLv3.

Resource icons are not bundled: NodeTaxi resolves Blizzard item icons at
runtime through GetItemIcon. See ATTRIBUTION.md.
